Copyright in Sipral is held in full by:

    Tiberiu Balasea

Every file carries an SPDX header naming that holder. Sole ownership is what
makes the dual licence in LICENSING.md possible: only the holder of all rights
can offer the same code under a commercial arm.

External code contributions are not accepted before 1.0. After that they are
accepted only under a contributor licence agreement that assigns the same rights
to the holder above. That agreement is not written yet; it will be published in
CONTRIBUTING.md before the first patch is taken. Issues, test captures and
interoperability reports are welcome at any time and are not code
contributions.
